			if the esQosBandwidthTxRateMode selected as:
			rate: means egress rate limit(units:kbps) and the effective rangs are 64 ~ 10000000.
			percent: means the percentage and the effective rangs are 1 ~ 100.            
	       	"
		::= { esQosBandwidthCtrlEntry 4 }	      
	
